# .env.example — the committed skeleton; copy to `.env` (gitignored, never committed).
# .env.example——已提交的骨架；复制为 .env（被 gitignore，永不提交）。
#
# ── This file is the SCHEMA, not just an example · 本文件即“模式定义” ─────────
#
# `scripts/env.sh` reads the FORM of each line, so the form must be accurate:
# scripts/env.sh 按“行的形式”读取本文件，因此形式必须准确：
#
#   · an assignment line that is NOT commented out  ->  REQUIRED
#   · an assignment line that IS commented out      ->  OPTIONAL, and the
#     value it shows is the default already in effect
#
# (Those two rules are stated in prose on purpose: any `NAME` + `=` written in
# a comment here would itself be parsed as a variable declaration.)
#
# Only two variables are uncommented below, because only two make the Go server
# refuse to boot (`config.Load`). Anything with a working code or compose
# default is commented — uncommenting it would make `env.sh check` report a
# non-problem, and a checker that cries wolf gets ignored.
# 下面仅两个变量未被注释——因为只有这两个会让 Go 服务拒绝启动；其余均有默认值。
#
# A live value byte-identical to the one shown here is reported as `default`
# (it came from this skeleton) rather than `set` (you chose it). That is never
# an error — `15m` really is the intended access-token lifetime. The values
# only you can supply ship as `change_me…`, so they surface as placeholders.
# 与此处完全相同的值会被报告为 default（来自骨架）而非 set（你的选择）；这不是错误。
#
# ── How your values reach the processes · 值如何到达进程 ──────────────────────
#
# Nothing reads this file directly. Three bridges make `.env` live:
# 本文件不被直接读取，由三座桥接使其生效:
#   · scripts/dev.sh          — exports it, then runs a command:
#                               ./scripts/dev.sh -C server|client <cmd>
#   · scripts/env.sh propagate — no-op unless a component owns a .env.example
#   · docker-compose.yml      — interpolates ${VAR} from it automatically
#
# Set up, inspect and validate (values are never printed) / 配置、查看与校验:
#   ./scripts/env.sh init        # interactive setup / 交互式配置
#   ./scripts/env.sh edit        # scrollable list of every variable + its state
#   ./scripts/env.sh check       # validate / 校验
#   ./scripts/env.sh propagate   # no-op unless a component owns a .env.example
# scripts/dev.sh runs `env.sh check <component>` before launching anything.
#
# Naming / 命名: ecosystem vars keep their conventional names (DATABASE_URL,
# GITHUB_TOKEN, POSTGRES_*); app-owned vars are prefixed
# INSIDEOUT_*. Flutter web bakes API_BASE at build time; it does not
# read this file.

# ── REQUIRED · Go backend (server/internal/config) ───────────────────────────
#
# DATABASE_URL — docker-compose cannot derive it from the other vars below
# (Compose does not support nesting ${...} inside a :- default), so set it
# explicitly for whichever of the two setups you use:
# DATABASE_URL 为必填——Compose 无法从其它变量派生，需按用法显式设置：
#
#   (a) Remote instance (dev default) — any host, e.g. Neon/RDS/self-managed.
#       DATABASE_URL is the runtime role insideout_app (DML, subject to RLS).
#       Migrations use DATABASE_OWNER_URL (insideout_owner, NOSUPERUSER).
#   (b) Bundled docker-compose `postgres` — app URL password matches
#       POSTGRES_APP_PASSWORD; owner URL password matches POSTGRES_OWNER_PASSWORD:
#       postgres://insideout_app:<app password>@postgres:5432/insideout?sslmode=disable
DATABASE_URL=postgres://insideout_app:change_me@your-remote-host:5432/insideout?sslmode=require

# INSIDEOUT_JWT_SECRET — HMAC signing secret for access/refresh JWTs.
# Minimum 32 characters; the server fails fast otherwise. Generate one with
# `openssl rand -hex 32`, or let `./scripts/env.sh init` do it for you.
# 访问/刷新 JWT 的 HMAC 签名密钥，至少 32 字符，否则服务端快速失败。
INSIDEOUT_JWT_SECRET=change_me_to_a_long_random_string

# ── OPTIONAL · Go backend ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Each line shows the default already in effect. Uncomment only to change it.
# 每行展示的即为当前生效的默认值；仅在需要修改时取消注释。

# Access-token lifetime (Go time.Duration) / 访问令牌有效期
#INSIDEOUT_ACCESS_TTL=15m

# Refresh-token lifetime (Go time.Duration) / 刷新令牌有效期
#INSIDEOUT_REFRESH_TTL=720h

# HTTP listen address; under docker, SERVER_PORT maps onto it / 监听地址
#INSIDEOUT_ADDR=:8080

# Secure attribute on auth cookies. Only the exact value 0 turns it off —
# needed when browsing over plain http, or the browser drops the cookies.
# 认证 cookie 的 Secure 属性；仅精确值 0 关闭，纯 HTTP 本地开发时需要。
#INSIDEOUT_COOKIE_SECURE=0

# Permissive CORS for dev. Only the exact value 1 turns it on. Rarely needed:
# the browser talks same-origin through the Nuxt proxy.
# 开发环境宽松 CORS；仅精确值 1 开启。通常不需要——浏览器经 Nuxt 代理同源访问。
#INSIDEOUT_DEV_CORS=1

# Exact Origin allow-list for browser clients that are not same-origin
# (Flutter web during the Nuxt overlap). Comma-separated. The token
# localhost matches http(s)://localhost:<port> and 127.0.0.1 only.
# Native Flutter apps do not need CORS. Empty = off.
#INSIDEOUT_CORS_ORIGINS=

# Optional. Connection as insideout_owner for DDL / migrate. Required once
# the owner/app split is in effect — SECURITY DEFINER functions must be
# owned by insideout_owner, never a superuser. Empty = migrate uses
# DATABASE_URL (only valid if that role already is insideout_owner).
#DATABASE_OWNER_URL=

# GitHub PAT for commit sync. Empty keeps the unauthenticated rate limit.
# GitHub 提交同步用的 PAT；留空则使用未认证速率限制。
#GITHUB_TOKEN=

# GitHub App webhook shared secret (HMAC-SHA256, X-Hub-Signature-256).
# Same value as the app's Webhook secret on github.com. Empty disables
# POST /api/v1/hooks/github (503).
#INSIDEOUT_GH_WEBHOOK_SECRET=

# GitHub App identity for installation access tokens (server-to-server;
# no user OAuth). PRIVATE_KEY is the app's .pem with newlines escaped
# as literal \n (single .env line); PRIVATE_KEY_FILE pointing at the
# .pem wins when set.
#INSIDEOUT_GH_APP_ID=
#INSIDEOUT_GH_CLIENT_ID=
#INSIDEOUT_GH_CLIENT_SECRET=
#INSIDEOUT_GH_PRIVATE_KEY=

# ── OPTIONAL · AI provider ───────────────────────────────────────────────────
# An empty INSIDEOUT_LLM_API_KEY is a CHOICE, not a gap: it selects the offline
# template-reply coach, which runs the whole PRD flow with no network and no
# cost. Put any /v1 prefix on the base URL yourself; the server appends only
# /messages or /responses from INSIDEOUT_LLM_SCHEMA.
# 留空 INSIDEOUT_LLM_API_KEY 是一种选择而非缺失：即离线模板回复模式。
# 请自行在 BASE_URL 里写上 /v1；服务端只按 SCHEMA 追加 /messages 或 /responses。

#INSIDEOUT_LLM_API_KEY=
#INSIDEOUT_LLM_BASE_URL=https://api.anthropic.com/v1
#INSIDEOUT_LLM_MODEL=claude-sonnet-4-20250514
#INSIDEOUT_LLM_SCHEMA=messages

# ── OPTIONAL · docker-compose only (docker-compose.yml) ──────────────────────
# Host-side ports and bundled-postgres bootstrap. Inside the containers the
# server listens on :8080 and postgres on 5432 regardless. Flutter is not
# a compose service. Skip this whole block for bare `go run` / `dev.sh` use.
# 主机侧端口与自带 postgres 的引导变量；容器内部端口固定。裸跑时整段可忽略。

#SERVER_PORT=8080
#POSTGRES_PORT=5442

# Required ONLY when DATABASE_URL points at the bundled postgres — compose has
# a :? guard on it, and it must equal the password embedded in DATABASE_URL.
# `env.sh check` enforces that pairing when it detects the bundled setup, which
# is why the line is commented here: for the remote setup it is simply unused.
# 仅当 DATABASE_URL 指向自带 postgres 时必填，且须与 URL 中的密码一致。
#POSTGRES_APP_PASSWORD=

# Bundled postgres: password for insideout_owner (migrate / DEFINER owner).
# Must match the password in DATABASE_OWNER_URL when that URL is set.
#POSTGRES_OWNER_PASSWORD=

# Bootstrap superuser for the postgres image only — the app never connects with
# it. See docker/postgres-init/. / 仅用于引导 postgres 镜像，应用从不用它连接。
#POSTGRES_SUPERUSER_PASSWORD=insideout_dev_password
